     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29b-5§6 Per-class hooks: door oxidation (9.3 example): the lower half becomes the next weather state and the upper half takes it with half = upper: the lower half ticks (1), the" TO TL-CASE
